2026-07-27T08:23:53.7512365Z Start test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
2026-07-27T08:23:53.7579755Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T08:23:53.7580434Z i /tmp/Rtmp2iPGnM/duckdb
2026-07-27T08:23:53.7580790Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T08:23:53.7581212Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T08:23:53.7581856Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T08:23:53.7582444Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T08:23:53.7583299Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T08:23:53.7584240Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T08:23:53.7837945Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:23:53.7947360Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:23:53.8405014Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:23:53.8574544Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
